Part Two
description: Data islands and spellings
- !!yo
  count: 0xff # a hex raw
  huge: 1e3
  always: .inf
  flag: True
  ~: the null-keyed value
  flow: [1, 2, 3]
  knr: {
    a: 1,
    b: 2,
  }
- !!set
  - one
  - two
- Annotated prose carries an overlay.
  yamlover-annotations:
    - *:: tags: important
- *: data.csv
